Z||000007||mrfiero||10-18-2001||02:39 PM||||I don't believe they are sagging......I'll see what those rear springs look like and will get back to you. Shipping will likely be around $20 for all 4 springs.  That's just a 'guesstimate' though and may be more or less than that.<P>Give me until Saturday to look at the rear springs.....the junker is about 50 miles away and I just won't have the time to check until the weekend.<p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 10-18-2001).]||||reg||1
