Z||000009||sqoach||10-18-2001||04:30 PM||||A little off topic, but does anyone know how many different spring rates there were? And which fieros had them? I'm guessing the basic 4cyl coupe had the softest springs, and the GT's were the stiffest.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">              <BR>^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 SC 2.5L 5spd</FONT>||||reg||5
