Z||000011||MrPBody||10-18-2001||08:58 PM||||Find some 4-cylinder WS6 springs.  As I recall, the right rear spring (for a 4-cylinder) is stiffer than the left rear, probably due to the engine's offset center of mass.<BR>||||reg||1
